#. module: muk_ai_product
#: model:muk_ai.skill,description:muk_ai_product.skill_complete_product
msgid ""
"Find the facts of the open product in its own data, its documents and on the"
" web, write its texts from those facts in every product language for "
"approval, and offer image variants."
msgstr ""
